[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0333","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0873","title":"Taylor UUCP 1.0.6 - Argument Handling Privilege Escalation 漏洞","description":"Taylor UUCP 1.06 版本的 uuxqt 组件未能正确过滤和移除危险的长选项参数，允许本地用户通过调用 uux 并使用 --config 选项指定备用配置文件来提升权限。该漏洞为本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者需先在目标系统上拥有本地账户权限，利用 uux 命令的参数处理缺陷，可绕过权限检查获取更高权限，进而在系统上执行任意操作。CVSS 评分为 7.2，属于高危级别。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0873"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08.720","remediation":"升级 Taylor UUCP 至 1.07 或更高版本以修复参数处理缺陷。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-079 安全通告更新 uucp 包，Red Hat 用户应应用 RHSA-2001:165 通告中的补丁，Caldera 用户参考 CSSA-2001-033.0，SuSE 用户参考 SuSE-SA:2001:38。临时缓解措施：移除 uuxqt 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/uuxqt），并限制本地用户对 uux 命令的调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000425","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100715446131820","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-165.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-033.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-079","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_038_uucp_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/212892","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3312","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/91b7f8a86c778da65a1fe33c64b708fe3875c0e3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0873.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0873","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d0559163b1a8bfdd19709ab97d90eb1d679f1671/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0873.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dfa0c652458f6076ec06eb7e370bd1f48212ff84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0873.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cx5-vc2r-w88x/GHSA-8cx5-vc2r-w88x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-079.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0873.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-079.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0333.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0333.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0331","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0872","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH UseLogin环境变量传递漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.0.1 及更早版本在启用 UseLogin 选项时，未对关键环境变量（如 LD_PRELOAD）进行有效过滤和清理。攻击者可在已登录目标系统的条件下，通过设置 LD_PRELOAD 等环境变量加载恶意共享库，在 SSH 会话切换过程中获取 root 级执行权限。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 早期版本中启用了 UseLogin 功能的 Linux/Unix 系统，利用条件要求攻击者已具有本地用户访问权限，最终可导致本地权限提升并完全控制目标主机。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0872"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08.570","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.0.2 或更高版本（如 OpenSSH 3.0.2p1 及以上），或在 sshd_config 中将 UseLogin 设置为 no 并重启 sshd 服务禁用 UseLogin 功能；同时建议在 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 中设置 PermitUserEnvironment no 并重启 sshd 服务以禁止用户自定义环境变量，彻底阻断 LD_PRELOAD 等环境变量注入提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000446","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/secur