ob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0331.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0330","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0869","title":"Cyrus SASL 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus SASL 库 common.c 文件中的默认日志回调函数 _sasl_syslog 存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的日志数据包利用该漏洞执行任意命令。该漏洞影响广泛的 Cyrus SASL 库用户，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，威胁等级极高。Cyrus SASL 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0869"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08.197","remediation":"升级 Cyrus SASL 库至 2.1.8 或更高版本（修复了 _sasl_syslog 中的格式化字符串漏洞），或升级到厂商提供的修复版本（如 Cyrus SASL 2.1.10+）。若无法立即升级，可通过配置 syslog 禁用 SASL 认证日志记录功能作为临时缓解措施，或在防火墙层面限制 SASL 服务的网络访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000444","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:018","http://lwn.net/alerts/SuSE/SuSE-SA%3A2001%3A042.php3","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-040.0.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-150.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-151.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3498","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7443","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0869.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0869","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0869.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0869.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qjxx-h2x5-mvmp/GHSA-qjxx-h2x5-mvmp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0869.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-018.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0869.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0398","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0876","title":"Microsoft Windows UPnP NOTIFY 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0876是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0876"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-20T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09.083","remediation":"标签中。<value>安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-059 对应补丁：Windows XP 用户安装 Q315000 补丁（该修复后续包含于 Windows XP Service Pack 1），Windows 98/98SE 用户安装 Q314941 补丁，Windows ME 用户安装 Q314757 补丁，可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Download Center 下载安装。如暂时无法安装补丁，请在防火墙中阻断 UDP 1900 和 5000 端口，并禁用 SSDP Discovery Service 与 Universal Plug and Play 组件以临时降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100887440810532&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=100887271006313&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-37.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-030.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/951555","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3723","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-059","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7721","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21189","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0876.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0876","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0876.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0876.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/upnp_xp_tcp.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxhg-8327-3c3x/GHSA-fxhg-8327-3c3x.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/smb_xp_ms01-059.nasl","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/91a96868b7c8ed9925661943b06d85609640f622/packages/cve_diff/data/samples/random_200_full_v3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0341","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0889","title":"Exim 邮件服务器 代码执行漏洞","description":"Exim 3.22 及更早版本在特定配置下存在命令注入漏洞。当邮件系统配置将邮件地址重定向到管道处理时，Exim 未能正确验证邮件地址的本地部分，导致远程攻击者可通过构造包含 Shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）的恶意邮件地址，实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Exim 3.22 及更早版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者可通过发送特制邮件触发漏洞，在服务器上下文执行任意 Shell 命令，进而完全控制邮件服务器。建议升级至 Exim 3.23 或更高版本，或禁用管道重定向功能。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0889"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09.967","remediation":"建议立即升级 Exim 至 3.23 或更高版本（如 4.x 稳定版），该版本修复了管道地址本地部分验证缺陷。若暂时无法升级，请在 Exim 配置文件中禁用 pipe 传输（注释或删除 transport/pipe 配置段），或在路由器配置中禁止 address_pipe 选项，防止远程攻击者通过 shell 元字符注入任意命令。同时建议在邮件网关层面部署邮件内容过滤规则，拦截包含管道字符（|）的异常地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100877978506387&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-097","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/283723","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-176.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7738","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0889","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0889.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5432-vj89-rgm6/GHSA-5432-vj89-rgm6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0889.md","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/c071ecf55c75d9da4d25f2554f790d734c763312/data/anchore/2001/CVE-2001-0889.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_097_1.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0358","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0797","title":"Solaris /bin/login 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"System V 衍生操作系统的 `/bin/login` 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 telnet、rlogin 等远程登录服务，向目标系统传入大量额外参数触发该溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令并完全控制主机。该漏洞影响基于 System V 的多种操作系统版本（包括 Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7/8 等），攻击者无需任何凭据即可从网络发起利用。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重，Metasploit 等工具已公开相关利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0797"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:58.607","remediation":"对于运行 Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7/8 的 SPARC 架构系统，立即升级到 Solaris 8 Update 1 或更高版本以修复 /bin/login 中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，请在系统上禁用 telnet 和 rlogin 服务（通过 /etc/inetd.conf 注释掉相关行并重启 inetd），仅允许使用 SSH 协议进行远程登录。对于无法停用的服务，可在网络边界防火墙处限制源 IP 地址，仅允许受信任的主机访问 telnet/rlogin 端口（23/513）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100844757228307&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/213","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY26221&apar=only","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-34.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/569272","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/246487","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3681","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise105.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7284","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2025","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10036","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0797.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7bafe961419ed00378435555d77a3a118a4791ff/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0797.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0797","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Kicksecure/security-misc/blob/7f55b21b018a8133a2ab5cc82bc5145caa8f0174/README.md","https://github.com/0xdea/exploits/blob/7577132dfcc4ac851bc8319b5d96d86f939d7380/solaris/raptor_rlogin.c","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/8490.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5vwx-44rv-q6c2/GHSA-5vwx-44rv-q6c2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ttyprompt.nasl","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b3f812bd4b5f3ade59f8b9defed21f6c3f9dab55/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0797.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0358.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0343","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0890","title":"SANE 后端驱动 不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"SANE 扫描仪访问库 1.0.3 及更早版本的某些后端驱动程序存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞。前端软件（如 XSane）在使用这些后端驱动时，会在创建临时文件时未进行安全检查，导致本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击修改任意文件。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用竞争条件在临时文件创建前建立指向敏感文件的符号链接，从而实现任意文件修改。该漏洞影响使用 SANE 1.0.3 及早期版本的扫描软件，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问/低复杂度/部分完整性影响），危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0890"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:10.083","remediation":"建议升级 SANE 库至 1.0.4 或更高版本（该版本修复了后端驱动程序中临时文件的符号链接攻击漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可通过设置安全的临时文件目录权限（如设置 sticky bit：chmod +t /tmp）或配置 SANE 后端使用专用、权限受限的临时目录来缓解符号链接攻击风险。同时建议限制本地用户对扫描服务的访问权限，降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-171.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7714.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3987","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0890","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0890.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhh8-m9xh-rhqw/GHSA-hhh8-m9xh-rhqw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0890.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0890.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9dae9d0f-cfb5-4dfd-a857-94f8b4a3b117.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0393","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0857","title":"Horde IMP 跨站脚本会话劫持漏洞","description":"tags.<value>IMP Webmail（Horde 项目的一部分）2.2.6 及更早版本中的 status.php3 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 并向 message 参数注入 JavaScript 代码，诱骗已登录用户访问该页面，从而在用户浏览器中执行恶意脚本并窃取其会话 Cookie。攻击者利用获取的会话 Cookie 即可劫持其他用户会话，无需密码即可登录目标账户，查看、转发或删除邮件内容，甚至获取邮件中存储的敏感个人信息。该漏洞影响 Horde IMP 2.2.x 系列，攻击条件为攻击者能够诱导已认证用户点击恶意链接，利用门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0857"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06.717","remediation":"立即升级到 Horde IMP 2.2.7 版本，该版本已修复 status.php3 中的跨站脚本漏洞。升级方式：从 ftp://ftp.horde.org/pub/imp/ 下载 imp-2.2.7.tar.gz 并覆盖安装，或使用 patch-imp-2.2.6-2.2.7.gz 补丁进行热修复。同时配置 session.cookie_httponly=1 和 session.use_strict_mode=1 以增强会话 cookie 安全性，临时缓解措施还包括在 Web 服务器层面禁用 status.php3 的 GET 参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000437","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100535679608486&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100540578822469&w=2","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-039.0.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/668","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3525","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7496","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c474180208f952ad61aa8eca8d07115fb6f16a5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0857.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0857","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6407093a9e2b3e61a3960c2e290e4a0a028bf4e0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0857.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4190a549751bffc11b00246a033a062f4109e196/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0857.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q4p-cfxj-gj9f/GHSA-6q4p-cfxj-gj9f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/imp_session_hijacking.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0857.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0857.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0391","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0855","title":"Rational ClearCase DB Loader TERM 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.x 及更早版本中的 db_loader 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。程序在处理 TERM 环境变量时未正确校验长度，本地攻击者可通过设置过长的 TERM 环境变量触发栈溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 ClearCase 4.2 及更早版本（含 3.2/4.x），攻击条件为具备本地用户权限且无需额外认证；成功利用后可完全破坏机密性、完整性与可用性，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。\"\"\"\n```\n\nI see the problem - the description field has a newline and then `<value>` inside the triple quotes, which would make the description start with \"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.\" followed by a newline and then the actual content. Actually wait, looking more carefully:\n\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\nRational ClearCase 3.2/4.\n\n<value>Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.x 及更早版本中的 db_loader 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。...\n```\n\nThis seems like a malformed TOML/insertion. The description string contains \"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.\" on one line, then a blank line, then `<value>Rational...` \n\nBut the task says the error is `description: description 字段为空`. This might mean the validator sees the description as empty for some reason, or there might be parsing issues.\n\nWait, the task asks me to fix the description field. The content between `<value>` and `\n","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0855"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06.470","remediation":"将 Rational ClearCase 从受影响的 3.2/4.0/4.1/4.2 及更早版本升级到 4.2 之后的修复版本；若无法立即升级，以 root 执行 chmod a-s /usr/atria/etc/db_loader 去掉 setuid 位，并限制普通用户执行该程序及本地登录权限，防止通过超长 TERM 环境变量触发溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100528623328037&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7488.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bi