y":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0839"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:04.230","remediation":"建议立即升级 iBill 密码管理系统至最新版本（建议升级至 2001 年 12 月后发布的修复版本），并立即修改 MASTER_ACCOUNT 默认主账户密码为强密码（≥12 位含大小写数字特殊字符）。若无法立即升级，请在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache/.htaccess）限制 ibillpm.pl 仅允许受信 IP 访问，并禁用弱密码生成逻辑，强制启用强密码策略。同时检查 .htpasswd 文件是否已被篡改，必要时重置所有账户密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100404371423927&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3476","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7352","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21129","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0839.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0839","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0839.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0839.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r5wp-92q4-r3r8/GHSA-r5wp-92q4-r3r8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0839.md","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/ibillpm_detect.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0839.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3476/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0388.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0386","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0386.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0838","title":"Network Solutions Rwhoisd 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NSI Rwhoisd 1.5.x 存在格式化字符串漏洞，攻击者可通过 -soa 命令中的格式说明符注入恶意输入，无需身份认证即可远程触发该漏洞。漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的格式字符串进行过滤和校验，导致攻击者可利用 %n 等格式说明符读写内存，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 Rwhoisd 1.5.x 的服务器系统，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击条件为攻击者可直接向目标发送特制请求，利用方式是通过构造包含格式字符串 specifiers 的 -soa 命令参数来操控程序执行流程。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0838"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:04.090","remediation":"建议立即升级 NSI Rwhoisd 至 1.5.7 或更高版本（Network Solutions 已发布修复补丁）。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面限制 4321 端口（Rwhois 默认端口）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或在防火墙层面过滤包含格式化字符串特征（如 %n、%s、%x 等）的 -soa 命令参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100402652724815&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21128","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0838.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0838","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0838.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0838.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxwv-v223-5w4w/GHSA-xxwv-v223-5w4w.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rwhois_format_string.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0838.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0386.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0384","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0384.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0836","title":"Oracle 9iAS Web Cache 2.0 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle9iAS Web Cache 2.0.0.1 版本在处理 HTTP GET 请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Oracle9iAS Web Cache 2.0.0.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（CVSS:AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造超长的 HTTP GET 请求 URL 触发缓冲区溢出，进而控制程序执行流执行任意 Shellcode。ExploitDB (Exploit-DB-21121) 等公开渠道已有公开 Exploit 代码，攻击者可直接利用实现远程代码执行。Oracle 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快升级至修复版本或应用官方补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0836"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03.790","remediation":"建议升级至 Oracle9iAS Web Cache 2.0.1.0 或更高版本（需联系 Oracle 获取补丁补丁集 Patchset 2.0.1.0 或更高版本）。若无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制对 Web Cache 管理端口（默认 4000/4001/4002）和 HTTP 端口（默认 7777/7778）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问；同时在 Web Cache 配置文件 webcache.xml 中限制最大 HTTP 请求长度（设置 <MAX_REQUEST_LENGTH> 限制 URL 长度），并禁用不必要的管理端口对外暴露。若业务允许，建议迁移至 Oracle Web Cache 10g/11g 或更高版本并及时应用 Oracle 官方安全补丁（参考 Oracle Critical Patch Update 补丁）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100342151132277&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100395487007578&w=2","http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/webcache.pdf","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-29.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/649979","http://www.osvdb.org/5534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7306","https://www