","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1247"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:53.420","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP 至 4.0.6 或更高版本（推荐升级至 PHP 5.6+ / 7.x / 8.x 版本），PHP 5.3+ 已废弃安全模式，5.4+ 已彻底移除。无法立即升级时，请在 php.ini 中设置 disable_functions = error_log, fopen, fwrite, file_put_contents 禁用危险函数，并设置 open_basedir 限制 PHP 脚本仅能访问指定目录，同时设置正确的文件系统权限，确保 Web 服务器进程 UID 仅拥有必要的最小读写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194425","http://www.osvdb.org/5440","http://www.php.net/do_download.php?download_file=php-4.1.2.tar.gz","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-035.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1247.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1247","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1247.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1247.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7cpc-xrrr-8qwm/GHSA-7cpc-xrrr-8qwm.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/PHP%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-1247).html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1247.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1247.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1247.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0383.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0382","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0833","title":"Oracle OTRCREP Oracle 8/9 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle OTRCREP 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，影响 Oracle 8.0.x 至 9.0.1 版本。本地攻击者可通过设置过长的 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行，完全破坏系统机密性、完整性和可用性（CVSS 7.2，本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、完全影响）。该漏洞被称为 \"Oracle Trace Collection Security Vulnerability\"，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，通过构造超长环境变量实现任意代码执行。Oracle 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0833"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03.170","remediation":"建议升级 Oracle 数据库至 9.0.1.4 补丁集或 9.2.0.1 及以上版本，或应用 Oracle 安全补丁 Alert #30 (Oracle Trace Collection Security Vulnerability)。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 otrcrep 可执行文件的执行权限（chmod 700 $ORACLE_HOME/bin/otrcrep），并限制 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量长度不超过 256 字符。建议限制非授权用户对 Oracle 安装目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100386756715645&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/201295","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/222612","http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/otrcrep.pdf","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-011.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3139","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6940","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0833.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0833","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee45