imeout、启用 tcp_tw_reuse）缓解资源耗尽风险。长期建议升级至官方最新稳定版并监控连接数异常。建议立即升级 6tunnel 至 0.09 或更高版本（已修复 socket 未正确关闭导致的资源耗尽漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制单 IP 连接频率（如 iptables 限制每分钟新建连接数），或在系统层面调整 TCP 连接超时参数（如降低 tcp_fin_timeout、启用 tcp_tw_reuse）缓解资源耗尽风险。长期建议升级至官方最新稳定版并监控连接数异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100386451702966&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3467","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7337","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0830.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0830","https://github.com/yaklang/yakit/blob/52a0094eccfbc0d3c5caff88cab946af323fb8df/app/renderer/src/main/src/pages/cve/CVEDescription.tsx","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0830.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0830.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x6j7-c99q-rch9/GHSA-x6j7-c99q-rch9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0830.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0380.toml"}]